WEBVTT

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:09.740
This is Moon Shuttle Flight ISDA 018,

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.710
requesting permission to land.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.240
This is the control tower.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.880
Flight ISDA 018, you are cleared to land.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.570
Copy.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.280
Kamishina-san...

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.690
I've been meaning to ask
you something for a while...

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.890
What is it?

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.890
Being the first man to
successfully land on Mars,

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:34.960
why are you piloting the regular
route between Earth and the Moon?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.070
Hey, now, this is an important job, you know.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.370
But as capable as you are,
there are important missions

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.540
that you could be carrying out to develop space

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.270
for the sake of all mankind.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.610
There's something I want to protect.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:49.370
Something... to protect?

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.050
Um...

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.120
Kamishina-san, have you
ever heard of D Project,

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.950
or the Dragonauts?

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:22.940
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:28.820
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:34.590
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:37.790
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:45.470
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:53.010
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.880
I'll always be with you

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.510
see the sky in front of you

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:02.880
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:10.060
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.730
utau yo

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:21.400
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.490
Mister Cyril, what did you
think after seeing this tragedy?

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:48.230
Exactly what is ISDA doing?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.530
Just what has happened to D Project?

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:54.000
D Project, which seeks retaliation,
has already begun.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.240
Can we take that as a declaration of war

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:57.670
against the extra-terrestrial life form?

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.910
Can you guarantee the safety of mankind?

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.880
- Any specifics as to your state of progress?
- Enough. Turn it off.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:05.610
- Right.
- Rash comments, just like always.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:08.850
To speak so frivolously
of retaliation like that...

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:12.520
Mister Cyril will arrive here in five minutes.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:15.960
Report the status of the Avenir.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.960
It will take six hours for setup.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.860
Have it done in three.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.940
That's impossible.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:33.600
Propellant 68% loaded.
180 seconds to TLP bootup.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:48.050
You're here.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.970
Gio...

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.820
Jin, are you all right?!

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:19.620
Hey, wake up, Gio!

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:30.190
Toa... Have to go help Toa...

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.330
Gio... we...

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.280
Raina-san...

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.450
Um...

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:00.730
What do you plan to do now?

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:04.030
I'm going to go get Toa back.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:08.040
No hesitation, huh? But what about after that?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.340
Are you going to keep running away together?

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.970
She is an important sample,

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:16.210
who can help us learn about Thanatos' biology.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.010
That's not something that we can ignore.

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:22.020
What are you trying to say?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:28.390
I'm at a loss. I don't want to expose
you to any more danger, but...

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.320
Ah, this is such a pain!

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:37.830
He's telling you to come be one of us!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:42.540
That was the whole idea at the beginning. Right?

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.340
You're too much, Howling Star.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:52.010
Kamishina Jin-kun, can I ask you
once again to become a Dragonaut?

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:56.950
But, I have to go save Toa.
Besides, becoming a Dragonaut

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:01.020
and defending Earth from
Thanatos is more than I can do.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:03.790
You've already defended Earth
from the Ostrum, haven't you?

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:08.630
But that wasn't because of my
ability. That was because of Gio.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:12.030
Believe in your own abilities, Kamishina Jin!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:19.270
Yeah! No matter how mighty the
powers that we possess may be,

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.240
it takes more than just that.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:25.250
We need Masters that are adept
at drawing that power out of us.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:28.280
So enough talk, let's soar
through space together!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.650
All the small stuff gets blown completely away

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:34.050
once you see this beautiful Earth from space.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.790
Dad...

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:42.960
You don't have to answer right away.
Won't you consider it, though?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.330
Raina-san,

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.130
why did you become a Dragonaut?

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.340
Because I wanted to test myself.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.740
To see what my potential was.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:01.280
It truly was an unfortunate accident.

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.320
And then...

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.030
I met you.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:52.470
So then, that was Resonance back then.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.200
It being an accident notwithstanding,

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:00.840
the crime of killing so many
earthlings was a serious one.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.850
I could not bring back the earthborn Dragons

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.350
without making up for that crime.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:10.590
That's why I cut off
communications with Thanatos,

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:15.490
and chose the path of living
together with the earthlings.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:19.760
You're not, by any chance,
thinking of taking revenge, right?

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.590
Ridiculous!

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:30.000
The Ostrum said that humans would change us.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.340
It would seem that Thanatos
did not agree with that.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.040
But I'm different.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.780
Right now, my mission is to make sure

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:42.280
that all of the remaining eggs hatch unharmed.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:47.420
Even if I go against Thanatos' will as a result.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.750
You have changed me.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.470
Professor Nozaki...

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.640
What do we do, Akira-chan?

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:12.980
Jin and Gio have been caught by ISDA again.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.980
Yeah, what do we do?

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:18.450
What do we do?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.980
Stop hounding me! That's what I'm trying to...

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:29.830
What are you up to, turncoats?

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.570
Sigelinde...

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.730
As a result of the Ostrum's attack,

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.270
D Project's implementation has been sped up.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:40.010
The Avenir will be taking off shortly.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.580
I see, then it's about to start.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.810
You're coming back, aren't you?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.980
You're going to fight alongside us, aren't you?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.740
Right?

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.020
What is it?

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:57.630
I've made up my mind to go with Jin and Gio.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.460
I want to see with my own eyes

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.460
what humans and Dragons are capable of.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:04.300
What are you saying?! You don't
have to have Jin do that,

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:07.670
Amadeus and I can show you!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:12.710
Say, Sigelinde, why don't you come with us?

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.110
You, together, with Jin.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:18.710
Together with Jin?

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.110
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:23.520
I'm not going to turn my back on my friends!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:26.890
No, huh? Okay.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.390
Avenir will be launching in two hours.

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:33.960
Everyone going aboard,
please take your posts at once.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.970
Repeat, Avenir will be launching in two hours.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.570
Let's go, Professor Nozaki.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.470
No, I'm going to stay here.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:44.140
I told you,

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:47.700
I cannot leave these little ones.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:52.480
I understand.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:56.220
Well, are you coming or not?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.580
I mean, come with us, you coward!

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:05.020
Sorry, but this is goodbye.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.400
What are you, dense?!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.500
What are you thinking?!

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.400
You're nasty! You're the worst!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.410
Jin... Kazuki...

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:27.350
...and now Akira...
stop going off and leaving me.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.190
It is time,

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.210
Young Miss.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:55.980
Catapult setting final sequence.
Commence all systems check.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:12:01.050
Linear rail... all clusters green.
Beginning electrical supply.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.280
Weather conditions... clear.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.150
Commencing catapult positioning.

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.980
Avenir, starting position hold.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:41.320
All passengers, please fasten
harnesses for acceleration.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:46.950
Repeat, all passengers, please
fasten harnesses for acceleration.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:55.000
Jin and Gio left after all, huh?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:59.200
Raina-san, why did you become a Dragonaut?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.510
Kamishina-san, have you ever heard of D Project,

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.980
or the Dragonauts?

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:13.890
Heard of it? I'm the one who
recommended you for D Project.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.720
Kamishina-san, you recommended me?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.120
As it happens,

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.790
there's an old classmate
of mine on the Project staff.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:23.730
He asked me if I knew anyone
who was cut out to be a Dragonaut.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:28.300
You're too kind. Isn't that something
that you yourself should go after?

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.570
You're a far superior astronaut than I am.

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:34.680
I have a family that I have to look after now.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:38.980
I can't do anything too reckless.
But Raina, you're still young.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.710
What do you say? Why don't you test yourself,

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.550
to see what your potential is?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.480
Potential?

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.860
You're giving me too much credit.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.760
When you're young,
you're brimming with potential.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.560
So don't be afraid.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.100
If you think you've made a mistake,
you can always turn back.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.200
You can have as many do-overs as you want.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.740
The important thing is to be true to yourself.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.570
Be true to myself?

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.240
Go and do as you believe!

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.270
That is being a man!

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.460
Kamishina-san...

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:26.590
Just watch me. I will do it,
believing in my own potential,

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.290
and your expectations.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:33.790
The countdown will start momentarily.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.410
Countdown start!

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.710
Right.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.800
Avenir, 300 seconds to taxi start.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.820
The Avenir...

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.050
Looks like it's almost time.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:56.960
Been looking for you.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.490
Jin...

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.560
Gio, should you be out of bed?

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.500
This is no time to be lounging around in bed.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.630
We have to hurry and rescue Toa.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.640
Gio and I are headed to Mars now.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.440
You're going to help Toa, right?

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:13.240
She might not be there anymore.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:16.580
I haven't heard Toa's song since, after all.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.650
But, since we don't have any
other leads, we have to go.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.450
There's no doubt that she was on Mars.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.320
I'd like you two to help us.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:28.350
Yeah, of course we will.
We'll follow you guys anywhere.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.660
Two Dragons ascending!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.800
It's Gio and Machina!

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.630
Let them be!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.860
Right now, focus on the Avenir's launch!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.870
He's mad at me.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.640
60 seconds to taxi start.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:52.210
Now what is it? He's going to snap at you again.

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:56.020
But Widow is flying in at high speed.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:58.680
It can't be! She was supposed to be missing!

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.000
Jin!!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.340
Kazuki?!

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:20.210
I've been waiting for this!
The moment that I do you in!

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.350
Jin! Are you okay?!

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:28.980
Machina, we're going in, too!

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.190
30 seconds to taxi start.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.320
Just a moment! If we take off like this,

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.320
there's a risk that we'll
collide with the Dragons!

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.160
If we miss this chance, we won't be able

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:41.660
to secure enough electricity
to restart the catapult.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.370
20 seconds to taxi start.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.730
Keep going as-is.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:54.440
10 seconds to taxi start... 8...

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:57.340
7... 6... 5...

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.450
4... 3...

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.280
2... 1... 0...

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.240
The catapult has been damaged!

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:32.210
- S-Stop us!
- I can't! There's no time!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.150
It's dropping!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:40.120
Aw, Jin, that was your fault!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.490
That's what you get for dodging!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.930
Hold on!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:57.400
If we keep going like this,
we won't attain ejection angle!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.270
Just a second!

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:03.680
It's Machina! Machina is
standing in for the girders!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.510
Hang in there, Machina!

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:07.410
Just a little more!

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:12.680
The catapult's distortion is within
tolerable levels! It will work!

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.260
Machina!

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.990
Here they come!

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.760
All right, it worked!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.950
Hmph, that's too bad.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.280
Now you've got fewer
friends to die along with you.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:44.550
But you, at least, aren't going anywhere!

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:47.490
Right here, right now, I'm gonna kill you!

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:56.330
Kazuki, stop!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.530
Jin, I'm gonna make you pay!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.520
I'll make you pay!

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.670
Now to finish you!

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:07.400
Take this!

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:15.650
Stay out of this!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.170
Stop!

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:40.610
Kazuki!!

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.010
We've achieved parking orbit.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:48.880
Conducting orbit shift toward
the Moon in 80 seconds.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.110
Prepare for acceleration.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:57.120
Kazuki...

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.760
Jin, let's get going.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.850
Yeah.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.730
A new relationship between Dragon and human...

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.330
It would be nice to find it, huh?

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.830
Yeah! We'll find it for sure!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:38.330
We wish you victory in your search.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.430
Take care, Sigelinde.

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:46.140
- Jin-kun...
- Yes?

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.740
Go and do as you believe!

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.570
That is being a man!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:57.580
That's what your father told me.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:01.120
Once I rescue Toa, I promise I'll be back.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:04.460
Right. I'll be waiting for you.

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:06.120
We're off!

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:13.590
I'm not alone anymore. It's Toa that is alone.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:22.170
Just sit tight, Toa. I'm coming to save you now!

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:27.270
Okay, Gio, let's go to Mars!

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:21.840
Hakisuteta kotoba no imi sae

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:24.100
fukaku kangaetari wa shinai

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:28.440
ima wo tada nigekiru dake

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:30.710
Mata nannimo nakatta you ni

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:32.850
onaji koto wo kurikaeshite'ru

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:36.520
Muimi nano yo mata sonna nige

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:45.390
Kekkyoku youchi de kodomo no manma da ne

00:22:45.390 --> 00:22:54.800
Hitori yogari kako no jibun wa mou sute na

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:59.310
Tadashii tatakai wa
sou kimi no naka de hajimaru

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:03.740
Kimi nara dou suru? Mou girigiri ja nai?

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:08.820
Houkai shite shimau mae ni arubeki sugata wo

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:15.920
omoiokoshite mite mi na yo

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:22.050
Fight or flight

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:29.500
Fight or flight

00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:46.290
Say, Saki-san and Ryoko-san,
let's play shiritori!

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:47.420
That came out of nowhere, huh?

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.260
I've been into it lately.

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:51.430
Okay, I'll start. "Afutaa faibu."
["After-Five"]

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:53.460
Let's see..."Buppousou." ["Dollarbird"]

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:56.360
"U... u... u... u... unaji"!
["Nape of the neck"]

00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:57.700
Huh? Who's that?

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:00.630
Just like I said, "u-na-ji"!

00:24:00.630 --> 00:24:02.170
"Jikaiyokoku!" ["Preview"]

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:05.040
"Ku"...After a lot of "kunan" ["Hardship"],
the captured princess is rescued!

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:07.530
Ah! Saki-san loses!
